  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Phuket Smart City Technical Assistance, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to Thailands Digital Economy and Promotion Agency (DEPA) is funding technical assistance that will provide a roadmap to support the implementation of ICT infrastructure necessary for buildout of smart city projects in Phuket Province, Thailand. USTDAs grant will enable expansion of functionality for the Phuket City Data Platform; upgrade of Phuket Provinces command center capabilities to improve city services and emergency communications systems; and modernization of core ICT infrastructure, including fiberoptic networks, data servers, cloud migration, cybersecurity, and 5G deployment.</narrative>
  </description>
